Where did you even find that guy?
Super Soldier factory? Or what?


00:36:56.065 --> 00:36:58.234
Are you intimidated?


00:36:58.442 --> 00:37:01.779
- How big is his bike?
- Huge.


00:37:01.863 --> 00:37:04.239
Really?


00:37:06.032 --> 00:37:08.494
Maybe Duke's wrong.


00:37:09.203 --> 00:37:13.790
He's keeping us alive this long, we've got to trust him.


00:37:13.791 --> 00:37:18.626
You don't want to go. You love
It, you think you're a warrior.


00:37:18.627 --> 00:37:20.797
I am a warrior.


00:37:32.224 --> 00:37:38.480
They say a swordsman that never
draws his sword... is a true master.


00:37:40.232 --> 00:37:42.776
They don't know shit about zombies!


00:37:56.039 --> 00:37:58.660
We had good luck with the SOV Force,
so that's where were going.


00:37:58.687 --> 00:38:01.459
Pick up some more can's.


00:38:01.460 --> 00:38:05.798
Now I got some extra muscle, I wanna
get as much fuel as possible.


00:38:06.715 --> 00:38:12.304
- Jude, I didn't ask you to come along.
- Like I stayed behind!


00:38:14.265 --> 00:38:17.850
- Anything to add, Major?
- It's your show.


00:38:17.851 --> 00:38:19.686
Let's go.


00:38:28.361 --> 00:38:31.489
Elvis, you fill!


00:38:32.323 --> 00:38:34.242
Four corners.


00:39:06.814 --> 00:39:08.483
Run.


00:39:10.735 --> 00:39:13.069
- What's going on?
- Were getting out of here!


00:39:13.070 --> 00:39:16.030
- What about the others?
- There not coming, come on.


00:39:16.031 --> 00:39:19.492
- I can't leave them!
- That's not my mission.


00:39:19.493 --> 00:39:23.370
- So what?
- Do the math kid. Duke is not gonna stick with the plan.


00:39:23.371 --> 00:39:25.137
Even if the others decided against him.


00:39:25.268 --> 00:39:28.000
There a liability...
We've got to be invisible.


00:39:28.001 --> 00:39:30.460
- You lied.
- Never said I take them.


00:39:30.461 --> 00:39:34.257
- You said you were alone.
- I am.


00:39:34.674 --> 00:39:39.804
We can do this easy or hard.
You're going home, Jude-- home...


00:39:41.305 --> 00:39:43.308
Yeah.


00:39:49.271 --> 00:39:51.357
No, let go!


00:39:54.234 --> 00:39:56.069
Hey, take your hands of her!


00:40:03.076 --> 00:40:05.995
I would have come this way too.


00:40:30.351 --> 00:40:31.853
What's going on? Duke.


00:40:32.896 --> 00:40:39.403
You're to dangerous, Major.
You won't stop. You won't give up!


00:40:39.944 --> 00:40:43.365
It's been a bind.


00:40:43.698 --> 00:40:46.326
I know the feeling.


00:40:47.034 --> 00:40:51.580
You think you're the first?
They've been others like you.


00:40:51.581 --> 00:40:56.877
Plans, weapons.
And they all died.


00:41:00.589 --> 00:41:04.509
You think you're different?
You think you're better?


00:41:06.385 --> 00:41:08.930
You didn't listen Major?


00:41:08.931 --> 00:41:12.391
I won't let any more of them die.


00:41:12.392 --> 00:41:17.522
I won't let you take any of them.
Not one, not any.


00:41:21.109 --> 00:41:24.195
I can save them.


00:41:42.336 --> 00:41:44.171
It's not that.


00:41:44.172 --> 00:41:46.007
What's wrong?


00:41:46.841 --> 00:41:48.969
Nothing, it's just stress.


00:41:57.185 --> 00:41:59.561
I'm listening, Duke!


00:42:00.270 --> 00:42:02.898
We can work this out.


00:42:03.482 --> 00:42:06.817
- I'm not going to kill you.
- Then, get these off me.


00:42:06.818 --> 00:42:11.114
I said, ...<i>I'm</i> not going to kill you!


00:42:13.283 --> 00:42:16.702
I know something you don't?


00:42:16.870 --> 00:42:18.955
Really?


00:42:18.956 --> 00:42:24.501
But I tell you what? If you're still
here in the morning. I let you go.


00:42:24.502 --> 00:42:25.878
Fair enough?


00:42:25.879 --> 00:42:28.172
You're gonna burn.


00:42:29.382 --> 00:42:32.092
Do you really think there is a
hell worse than this, Major?


00:42:32.093 --> 00:42:37.828
It's no joke. there gonna torch the
city, Duke... Burn the infection out.


00:42:39.767 --> 00:42:44.897
- You're Lying.
- Any day now. I take you with me.


00:42:45.230 --> 00:42:47.356
You're desperate, Gatling.


00:42:47.357 --> 00:42:50.151
- They've been discussing it for weeks.
- Who?


00:42:50.152 --> 00:42:53.112
- My government. Their government.
- How do you know?


00:42:53.113 --> 00:42:57.032
The girl, father's company who created the virus.


00:42:57.033 --> 00:43:02.704
- He sent me to get her out.
- But she ran away from you. She doesn't wanna go.


00:43:02.705 --> 00:43:05.206
- I didn't tell her.
- Really?


00:43:05.207 --> 00:43:10.963
Well if that's the best you got, Major.
I'm afraid I have to love you and leave you.


00:43:12.882 --> 00:43:14.758
Duke.


00:43:34.277 --> 00:43:36.694
- What's happening?
- Well, she's sick.


00:43:36.695 --> 00:43:40.074
I'm fine, just wanna clean up.


00:43:40.491 --> 00:43:42.284
I'll go.


00:43:58.216 --> 00:44:01.136
Oh, no!


00:44:18.736 --> 00:44:21.821
Hey buddy... you don't look so good.


00:45:21.753 --> 00:45:24.965
- Where's Max?
- He's gone.


00:45:26.092 --> 00:45:27.885
He's dead?


00:45:30.511 --> 00:45:36.309
- Major Gatling... chose to go his own way.
- Why would he do that?


00:45:37.478 --> 00:45:39.813
It was his decision.


00:45:42.900 --> 00:45:46.526
There is nothing more to say.


00:45:46.527 --> 00:45:51.157
Is there, Jude?... More to say?


00:45:52.783 --> 00:45:55.118
Like what?


00:45:55.119 --> 00:45:57.663
That's what I thought.


00:46:00.916 --> 00:46:02.793
Ah... Come, come.


00:47:04.559 --> 00:47:06.854
What are you...?


00:47:08.564 --> 00:47:10.357
Oh... Reese.


00:47:12.025 --> 00:47:14.193
- Reese!
- You stay here.


00:47:14.194 --> 00:47:17.822
- What are you doing?
- Stay here. Please. just... just stay.


00:47:21.367 --> 00:47:23.953
You fucking told him!


00:48:09.205 --> 00:48:10.705
Holy shit!


00:48:10.706 --> 00:48:12.625
The axe!


00:48:18.798 --> 00:48:20.716
Again.


00:48:22.967 --> 00:48:25.513
Can you walk?


00:48:30.391 --> 00:48:32.811
My gear.


00:48:52.788 --> 00:48:54.539
Sorry.


00:48:58.335 --> 00:49:02.005
I didn't know that they were gonna...


00:49:03.047 --> 00:49:05.028
Well, I had a pretty good idea.
So you know...


00:49:05.055 --> 00:49:07.078
I don't expect you to forgive me and all.


00:49:10.971 --> 00:49:15.309
- Listen, I need to know something.
- There it comes.


00:49:15.726 --> 00:49:19.147
Can you really get Jude out?


00:49:20.523 --> 00:49:22.816
Depends.


00:49:24.568 --> 00:49:27.696
- What changed?
- She's pregnant.


00:49:28.571 --> 00:49:32.284
Okay, I didn't know. I only just find out.


00:49:32.784 --> 00:49:38.205
So, she can't have it here. Okay, not in this.


00:49:38.206 --> 00:49:41.028
I help you. Anything you say-- you know.
Look-- look.


00:49:41.056 --> 00:49:43.904
You don't even have to take me with you.
I don't give a shit.


00:49:45.087 --> 00:49:46.839
Can you do it?


00:49:57.057 --> 00:49:59.600
Do you believe in God?


00:50:01.937 --> 00:50:06.609
Maybe there is... And this is really Hell.


00:50:13.365 --> 00:50:18.201
- Do you believe in anything?
- I believe in my mission.


00:50:24.291 --> 00:50:26.543
Do you got any kids?


00:50:27.878 --> 00:50:31.757
Look, you gonna have to go
outside, if you wanna keep this up.


00:50:33.050 --> 00:50:39.389
You know what, I tought someday--
but not so soon... A career and--


00:50:43.977 --> 00:50:48.355
I'm a Lab-Geek.
I do bacteria, not babies.


00:50:49.316 --> 00:50:54.654
Zombies everywhere you look, and
you're scared of dirty diapers?


00:51:02.286 --> 00:51:04.579
They're not zombies.


00:51:08.959 --> 00:51:11.961
She didn't tell me.


00:51:12.588 --> 00:51:15.924
Maybe she doesn't even wanna have the kid.


00:51:31.397 --> 00:51:33.315
Thanks.


00:51:38.445 --> 00:51:41.448
Now shut up.


00:51:58.089 --> 00:51:59.673
Where are you going?


00:51:59.674 --> 00:52:02.092
- Out.
- Why?


00:52:02.093 --> 00:52:04.219
He's out there.


00:52:06.221 --> 00:52:07.931
Who?


00:52:18.065 --> 00:52:20.026
Come on, this way.


00:52:24.072 --> 00:52:27.534
- Hold up.
- What-- what is it?


00:52:29.160 --> 00:52:31.121
Let's take a look.


00:52:32.205 --> 00:52:34.831
So, let me get this straight.


00:52:34.832 --> 00:52:38.137
Now it's Reese who's gone missing, and you who want


00:52:38.165 --> 00:52:41.281
to go look for him.
- I mean what is it with you two?


00:52:43.132 --> 00:52:45.675
- Oh please, no you stay put.
- Right.


00:52:46.510 --> 00:52:47.509
Jude.


00:52:47.510 --> 00:52:50.846
- What's going on?
- He didn't come back.


00:52:50.847 --> 00:52:52.431
Jude!


00:52:52.432 --> 00:52:54.391
I forbid it!


00:52:54.392 --> 00:52:57.394
You really do believe that dom title, don't you?


00:52:57.395 --> 00:53:00.732
Listen Jude... this is
stupid... you little fuck!


00:53:00.774 --> 00:53:04.861
Duke, she is pregnant!


00:53:06.655 --> 00:53:08.448
Shut your fucking mouth!


00:53:19.750 --> 00:53:23.252
That's why you ran away from Gatling.


00:53:27.507 --> 00:53:31.594
You wanted to be with the father.


00:53:33.721 --> 00:53:36.433
Oh, sweet fucking jesus.


00:53:45.065 --> 00:53:49.236
Robots?
Where they come from?


00:53:50.404 --> 00:53:52.321
Where are they going?


00:53:52.322 --> 00:53:54.784
Come on!


00:54:08.255 --> 00:54:10.506
Oh, no, no...


00:54:11.423 --> 00:54:13.468
What's wrong?


00:54:14.510 --> 00:54:18.806
- He said, there going to burn the city.
- What are you talking about?


00:54:18.807 --> 00:54:24.437
They are going to burn this city and everybody in it!


00:54:27.939 --> 00:54:31.151
Maybe there rescue robots.


00:54:39.242 --> 00:54:41.494
Bad boys.


00:54:44.622 --> 00:54:49.209
I think I know what they are.
That-- that-- huge refinery disaster, you remember.


00:54:49.210 --> 00:54:52.047
They had a bunch of prototype robots working.


00:54:52.074 --> 00:54:54.631
They all went berserk, shooting
people and tearing them apart.


00:54:54.632 --> 00:54:58.552
No one got out alive.
It's got to be them.


00:54:59.219 --> 00:55:03.556
Zombies... Killer robots?


00:55:03.557 --> 00:55:05.682
Nice town you got here!


00:55:05.683 --> 00:55:09.311
- Why didn't you tell us?
- Obviously, I though he was lying.


00:55:09.312 --> 00:55:11.981
Where is he?


00:55:12.524 --> 00:55:14.733
Where is he, Duke?


00:55:14.734 --> 00:55:17.277
Tied to a post.


00:55:17.278 --> 00:55:19.488
You fucking killed him?!


00:55:19.489 --> 00:55:23.700
To protect you, would you say
as much about your own father?


00:55:23.701 --> 00:55:26.369
Wait. Who?


00:55:26.370 --> 00:55:29.038
Oh yes, there's more.


00:55:29.039 --> 00:55:35.671
It's appears, that's Jude's father...
Cooked up this delightful plague of ours.


00:55:36.922 --> 00:55:43.345
Gatling was coming for her, he was
never going to take anyone else.


00:55:43.845 --> 00:55:46.096
You didn't give him a chance.


00:55:46.097 --> 00:55:50.476
He would have left us, all to burn.


00:55:51.686 --> 00:55:54.104
What do they look like to you?


00:55:56.899 --> 00:55:58.776
Robots.


00:56:00.236 --> 00:56:02.363
What do they look like to you?


00:56:03.572 --> 00:56:05.365
Soldiers.


00:56:08.619 --> 00:56:10.704
Go!


00:56:55.205 --> 00:56:57.791
What just happened?


00:57:09.051 --> 00:57:11.094
Don't move.


00:57:12.221 --> 00:57:14.431
Good-- good doggie...


00:57:20.145 --> 00:57:21.561
Say what?


00:57:21.562 --> 00:57:24.774
Do you require medical assistance?


00:57:25.442 --> 00:57:29.487
- What, what-- what do you mean?
- Are you injured?


00:57:30.697 --> 00:57:32.407
No.


00:57:33.574 --> 00:57:35.785
Okay so, now what?


00:57:37.662 --> 00:57:41.956
- What are you?
- Advanced utility robots.


00:57:44.335 --> 00:57:45.668
Where do you come from?


00:57:45.669 --> 00:57:51.174
These models where assembled at Midora
Industries Robotics Home... Tokyo.


00:57:51.175 --> 00:57:55.053
- How did you get here?
- We walked.


00:57:55.303 --> 00:57:59.014
- Are you dangerous?
- I do not understand.


00:57:59.015 --> 00:58:03.144
- Are you... gonna hurt us?
- No!


00:58:03.269 --> 00:58:05.645
- Did you ever hurt anyone?
- Yes.


00:58:05.646 --> 00:58:07.607
- Did you ever killed anyone?
- Yes.


00:58:07.608 --> 00:58:08.858
Why did you do it?


00:58:08.859 --> 00:58:11.581
The operating code of all models in service on


00:58:11.608 --> 00:58:14.362
the Midora deep crescent location was corrupted.


00:58:14.363 --> 00:58:18.200
Causing a system wide execution error.


00:58:18.701 --> 00:58:20.619
You got that?


00:58:23.329 --> 00:58:26.916
- So, what happened?
- The error was corrected.


00:58:26.917 --> 00:58:30.421
- What about them?
- I do not understand.


00:58:31.213 --> 00:58:33.588
Well there dead?
You killed them.


00:58:33.589 --> 00:58:36.425
- They are not people.
- How do you know that?


00:58:36.426 --> 00:58:40.136
Sensory devices indicate normal
thermal values are to low.


00:58:40.137 --> 00:58:42.013
They are not people.


00:58:42.014 --> 00:58:44.850
It means there to cold.


00:58:46.268 --> 00:58:48.729
- Can I touch you?
- Yes.


00:58:50.897 --> 00:58:53.441
Woo, serious nerd'gasm.


00:58:56.653 --> 00:59:00.491
- So, what's your mission?
- We are awaiting instruction.


00:59:01.950 --> 00:59:04.952
Well... I think we gonna
get along, just fine.


00:59:04.953 --> 00:59:07.039
Jude!


00:59:09.207 --> 00:59:10.999
- Jude!
- What!


00:59:11.000 --> 00:59:13.044
Is it true?


00:59:13.169 --> 00:59:15.795
That my dad created the zombie apocalypse.


00:59:15.796 --> 00:59:19.716
- What can I say, worst Disneyland dad ever!
- You should have told us!


00:59:19.717 --> 00:59:21.050
I have to find Reese.


00:59:21.051 --> 00:59:23.386
- You're not going anywhere.
- Leave me... alone!


00:59:23.387 --> 00:59:25.598
Jude!


00:59:37.943 --> 00:59:40.945
How did it get inside?


00:59:41.779 --> 00:59:44.574
I check the gate.


00:59:52.957 --> 00:59:54.584
Anna.


01:00:12.767 --> 01:00:14.852
Duke.


01:00:22.235 --> 01:00:24.195
No!


01:00:45.841 --> 01:00:49.052
There inside the gate.
There everywhere!


01:00:51.012 --> 01:00:53.430
What are we gonna do?


01:00:53.847 --> 01:00:56.226
What, we gonna do?!


01:00:58.352 --> 01:01:00.438
What's that?


01:01:06.986 --> 01:01:08.821
Reese!


01:01:19.414 --> 01:01:23.793
- You brought robots?
- It's cool, huh?


01:01:24.836 --> 01:01:26.419
Say hello, boys.


01:01:26.420 --> 01:01:28.338
- Hello.
- Hello... Hello.


01:01:29.756 --> 01:01:34.510
- Who is your commander?
- Major Max Gatling.


01:01:34.511 --> 01:01:38.681
- What do we do zombies?
- We fucked them up, we fucked them up!


01:01:38.682 --> 01:01:40.725
That's right.


01:01:40.726 --> 01:01:42.769
Who wants to get the hell outta here?


01:01:42.770 --> 01:01:45.104
- Me!
- Me!


01:01:45.105 --> 01:01:46.688
Let's go.


01:01:46.689 --> 01:01:52.028
Bring what ever you can carry, the deadlier
the better. We move out in thirty minutes.


01:01:57.826 --> 01:02:00.828
I did it... to protect them.


01:02:01.454 --> 01:02:03.246
Sure.


01:02:03.247 --> 01:02:08.919
Wait, wait... I need to know when
we get through this, do you...?


01:02:14.174 --> 01:02:18.679
- It was a mistake, I should not have left you out there.
- It's to late.


01:02:19.388 --> 01:02:21.765
Your taking him?


01:02:22.765 --> 01:02:27.104
Well he's the wingman, you're the Duke.


01:02:29.647 --> 01:02:33.943
Who the fuck finds robots, who
the fuck finds robots anyway?!


01:02:34.277 --> 01:02:38.529
I'm open to possibilities.
See you around, Duke.


01:02:38.530 --> 01:02:40.699
Wait!
Wait, wait...


01:02:40.700 --> 01:02:42.910
I can help you.


01:02:43.035 --> 01:02:47.874
I mean, the map? I can read
the map, I'm the only one.


01:02:48.290 --> 01:02:52.084
I mean... I've been out there. I
know what's going on out there.


01:02:52.085 --> 01:02:56.715
You got them, but... they got a army?


01:02:59.801 --> 01:03:01.803
Get in!


01:03:01.970 --> 01:03:05.348
You won't be sorry.


01:03:29.329 --> 01:03:31.248
Got, the love baby!


01:04:01.193 --> 01:04:02.986
Major?


01:04:09.868 --> 01:04:11.744
Keep moving.


01:04:15.831 --> 01:04:18.000
Inside.


01:04:22.129 --> 01:04:27.301
- Why are we stopping?
- We got work to do. Cover the gate.


01:04:27.468 --> 01:04:30.388
You two, up there.


01:04:30.513 --> 01:04:32.931
Let's go.


01:04:55.869 --> 01:05:00.249
Right, so... that should keep them
out for a while... And us in.


01:05:01.875 --> 01:05:04.940
- Hey you-- brought-- brought Duke?
- Were best friends.
- Hey listen-- listen.


01:05:04.941 --> 01:05:11.278
Are you sure about the fire bombing?
Jude's father told you?


01:05:11.279 --> 01:05:14.741
Are you surprised?


01:05:14.804 --> 01:05:16.639
No!


01:05:17.891 --> 01:05:19.808
It's the right thing to do.


01:05:19.809 --> 01:05:24.480
Major, generator... powered up if you want.


01:05:26.941 --> 01:05:30.403
Here or here.


01:05:30.903 --> 01:05:34.073
These are where the lines, the weakest.


01:05:35.825 --> 01:05:40.411
Your call... Show me the
best way to get there.


01:05:41.788 --> 01:05:46.250
Still the matter of the ground troops?
How do you propose we do that?


01:05:46.251 --> 01:05:49.002
Decoys.


01:05:49.003 --> 01:05:51.006
The robots!


01:06:13.194 --> 01:06:15.779
What do you think?


01:06:26.414 --> 01:06:29.083
I like it.


01:07:32.060 --> 01:07:34.145
Wicked.


01:07:41.736 --> 01:07:44.697
We'll go tomorrow.


01:07:51.911 --> 01:07:55.749
Hanging with your friends?


01:08:07.218 --> 01:08:09.553
He never blink, you know.


01:08:13.474 --> 01:08:19.105
Machine-- versus-- machine.


01:08:20.147 --> 01:08:22.399
Who will win?


01:08:26.278 --> 01:08:29.823
You lose if you have a heart, right?


01:08:31.616 --> 01:08:36.621
Don't worry, I can keep a secret.


01:08:36.788 --> 01:08:38.915
So I hear.


01:08:41.709 --> 01:08:49.300
Can't even tell, except when I'm spewing all over myself.


01:08:51.969 --> 01:08:56.264
I bet you're sorry, you took this mission.


01:08:56.265 --> 01:08:59.643
I'm sorry, I didn't ask for more money.


01:08:59.644 --> 01:09:06.066
Yeah, me too... My Dad, totally
bribed me to come for the summer.


01:09:07.400 --> 01:09:10.277
You don't seem like the science type.


01:09:10.278 --> 01:09:14.323
I'm-- well... One more strike
I'm out... type.


01:09:15.491 --> 01:09:19.536
My mission, had I chosen, to accept it...


01:09:19.537 --> 01:09:23.792
Was to get serious about my future.


01:09:25.376 --> 01:09:29.421
You think, getting knocked up counts?


01:09:31.631 --> 01:09:34.051
You can handle it.


01:09:35.636 --> 01:09:38.304
How do you know?


01:09:39.597 --> 01:09:42.058
I've been around, kid.


01:09:48.439 --> 01:09:54.196
- I'm thinking about hugging you, Max.
- Not in front of the robot.


01:10:05.038 --> 01:10:08.208
What are you looking at?


01:10:12.337 --> 01:10:15.840
Okay, let's see what we got here...


01:10:28.351 --> 01:10:30.230
What is it?


01:10:32.440 --> 01:10:35.818
- Assuming Alpha 3-3.
- Huh?


01:10:36.693 --> 01:10:39.988
Automated return function.


01:10:40.531 --> 01:10:42.325
Auto... what?


01:10:47.244 --> 01:10:49.997
- Unit malfunctioning.
- Crap!


01:10:49.998 --> 01:10:51.666
Weapons!


01:12:27.340 --> 01:12:29.801
Fuck you!
You fucking can opener!


01:12:41.228 --> 01:12:44.940
There still out there.
The robots are holding them off, on the street.


01:12:49.153 --> 01:12:51.695
- Times up!
- Is that the fire bombing?


01:12:51.696 --> 01:12:53.949
Were dead!


01:12:55.951 --> 01:12:59.747
They start in the centre and work there way out.


01:13:01.831 --> 01:13:03.833
Come on!


01:13:03.916 --> 01:13:05.919
There still out there!


01:13:06.670 --> 01:13:08.671
Get in! Come on! Do it!


01:13:11.131 --> 01:13:12.382
Where is he?


01:13:12.383 --> 01:13:14.510
You're okay?


01:13:17.012 --> 01:13:18.765
Seriously?


01:13:23.895 --> 01:13:25.186
Drive!


01:13:25.187 --> 01:13:27.981
There is no engine!


01:13:31.109 --> 01:13:34.070
- Duke!
- He is dead.


01:13:34.779 --> 01:13:38.032
- Are you sure?
- Uh-uh.


01:13:39.575 --> 01:13:42.162
No, no, no...


01:13:44.247 --> 01:13:47.081
- Where were going?
- We need cover, so we go deep.


01:13:47.082 --> 01:13:49.751
- Ghost City!
- Not helping.


01:13:49.752 --> 01:13:51.961
No. We gotta go Ghost City.


01:13:51.962 --> 01:13:56.050
It's really old. It's been sinking in the mud forever...
It goes real deep.


01:14:07.185 --> 01:14:10.145
Betrayal!!


01:14:10.146 --> 01:14:14.192
I saved them! Max!...
I saved them...


01:14:44.971 --> 01:14:47.222
You hold them back.


01:16:04.755 --> 01:16:07.258
There getting closer.


01:16:15.640 --> 01:16:18.394
Look for stairs!


01:16:18.519 --> 01:16:21.395
Guys, check it out!


01:16:22.813 --> 01:16:24.399
Come on!


01:16:25.484 --> 01:16:28.361
Elvis?!


01:16:28.903 --> 01:16:30.489
Stop!


01:16:34.366 --> 01:16:36.285
No!


01:16:38.287 --> 01:16:40.080
Careful, there might be more!


01:16:40.456 --> 01:16:42.082
No!


01:16:42.083 --> 01:16:44.918
Lynn, he's gone!


01:16:47.380 --> 01:16:49.506
Guys, guys they're coming!


01:16:51.799 --> 01:16:54.136
Let's go!


01:17:17.074 --> 01:17:19.659
Wait, you see that?
Up there.


01:17:38.385 --> 01:17:41.264
There everywhere!


01:20:04.483 --> 01:20:06.694
Hey, it's you again.


01:20:08.237 --> 01:20:09.988
Find Jude.


01:20:20.206 --> 01:20:23.502
Jude!


01:20:38.473 --> 01:20:39.766
Hey!... Down here!


01:20:40.601 --> 01:20:43.228
Reese, where's Jude?


01:20:43.771 --> 01:20:45.439
Reese!


01:20:46.106 --> 01:20:47.650
Jude.


01:20:50.401 --> 01:20:52.111
Look out!


01:21:31.107 --> 01:21:37.072
Gatling...
You stupid son of a bitch!


01:21:50.500 --> 01:21:52.920
Where is he?


01:22:33.917 --> 01:22:36.044
It's over.


01:22:43.467 --> 01:22:45.093
Max!


01:23:02.402 --> 01:23:04.696
You made it!


01:23:11.328 --> 01:23:13.955
You know, don't you?


01:23:17.042 --> 01:23:20.127
How did he find out, that it was me?


01:23:32.222 --> 01:23:35.433
What is your mission, Major Gatling?


01:23:35.434 --> 01:23:37.977
Rescue the girl...


01:23:38.895 --> 01:23:42.232
...Kill the whistleblower.


01:23:44.400 --> 01:23:47.527
And that way the company can deny,


01:23:47.554 --> 01:23:50.864
Everything that happend here...
Blame it on someone else...


01:23:50.865 --> 01:23:55.286
There won't be anyone to say any different.


01:23:55.828 --> 01:23:58.246
That's why you did it?


01:23:58.998 --> 01:24:05.212
I had to say something...
There was still a chance to stop it before...


01:24:08.006 --> 01:24:11.552
It's some pile of shit.


01:24:14.012 --> 01:24:15.845
Yeah.


01:24:15.846 --> 01:24:19.475
What are you guys so serious about?


01:24:19.726 --> 01:24:24.104
Hey... Come on, Max. You did it.
Mission accomplished.


01:24:24.105 --> 01:24:26.481
Now what?


01:24:29.568 --> 01:24:31.361
What?


01:24:43.081 --> 01:24:47.128
Now we get you and little Max, back where you belong.


01:24:49.483 --> 01:24:52.820
Whoo... Whoo...
Who said anything about naming him Max?


01:24:53.967 --> 01:24:56.843
A boy needs a good strong name!


01:24:56.844 --> 01:25:01.724
Not bad...
I think she likes it, just fine...


01:25:06.854 --> 01:25:10.983
Hey, buddy...
Why don't you go get me a coffee?
